\f0\fs24 \cf0 Week 12 Reflection:\
\
I built an AI summary tool for my business companion. I thought this was the best way I could meet this assignments criterion while still creating something semi-useful for me. Since I already have authentication I think an AI summary is the next best tool I could create.\
\
It was a lot easier than expected. Downloading Ollama was straightforward and it was running with no issues in just a couple commands. Claude code walked me through everything and it got everything correct first-time. The LLM acted like any other AI in terms of responses, Claude and I went through a few iterations of the prompts before dialing in on a good one.\
\
I learned that running a LLM locally is a lot easier than it seems. You just download it, tell claude what you want to do with it, and from there you can do all the tweaks to the LLM prompt within claude code. It is just like coding anything locally that you do not have to deploy live to test. It was a lot easier than trying to manage a cloud database like supabase.\
\
If I had more time, I would try to use a cloud LLM so that all users could generate a summary instead of having to run it locally.\
